        1,
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marion%2C_North_Dakota",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town sat at the end of a Northern Pacific branch line known as the \"lady line,\" a route that linked cities named after women.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marion%2C_North_Dakota",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 2014, Marion was highlighted on a \"Wheel of Fortune\" episode, where former resident Stephanie Limesand appeared.",
